# Thanos, the Mad Titan's power-up is activated only once (CR 702.193a). He enters on turn 5 and powers up for {C}{U}{G}
# (his {R}{W}{B} off {C}{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, CR 702.193b), paid with Sol Ring's {C}{C}, the Island and the Forest. Once it
# has resolved, Bot1 still has the spare {C}, Mox Sapphire and Mox Emerald, which would pay {C}{U}{G} again, and the
# ability is not offered a second time.

